+ Documented limit (documented-limit): Requested-scope JSON and CSS resolve brand/theme. Full CSS retains every built scope; TypeScript and Tailwind artifacts explicitly retain legacy A/light defaults. Source: [packages/mcp-server/src/tools/tokens.build.ts](../../packages/mcp-server/src/tools/tokens.build.ts).
