+
+ Documented limit (documented-limit): Owner: Forge code-generation maintainers. Static HTML preserves tab panel content and layout, but has no runtime for domain actions. Full Invoice/Usage detail HTML therefore returns OODS-V007 naming the unsupported binding; React/Vue application output owns executable actions. Source: [packages/mcp-server/src/codegen/target-contracts.ts](../../packages/mcp-server/src/codegen/target-contracts.ts).
