+ | Parameter / field | Type | Required in this branch | Default | Description / constraints |
+ |---|---|---|---|---|
+ | `status` | `"ok"` or `"error"` | Yes | — | Whether the dashboard composed successfully (ok even when individual panels failed to a placeholder). |
+ | `schemaVersion` | string | No | — | Echoes the DashboardSpec IR version. |
+ | `panels` | array of ref `"#/$defs/panelResult"` | Yes | — | Per-panel compiled results, in declared panel order. A chart panel carries its compiled spec; a kpi panel carries computed values; a failed panel becomes an a11y-described error placeholder (onPanelError default). |
